## Known failure modes

The template test set holds question shapes no training template has, and the results above show
how far this checkpoint carries to them. A query can be right on the original warehouse and wrong
on a twin: right for a reason the twins do not share, which the twin confirmed numbers count as
wrong. RESULTS.md and the site list the hacks every arm found.
